[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 16562.15, "timestamp": "04:36:02", "text": "在 Billy Billy 上玩 Valerant 吗？嗯？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16564.31, "timestamp": "04:36:04", "text": "等等，那和比利比利（Billy Billy）的规则冲突了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16565.75, "timestamp": "04:36:05", "text": "规则就是这样，对吧？等等，这违反了……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16568.31, "timestamp": "04:36:08", "text": "对吧，这是中国式的规则？等等，什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16571.269, "timestamp": "04:36:11", "text": "嗯？等等，伊森为什么玩《瓦莱兰特》？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16573.75, "timestamp": "04:36:13", "text": "在比利比利身上？什么？当我观看时"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16575.67, "timestamp": "04:36:15", "text": "他在 Billy Billy 上的直播，他"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16578.39, "timestamp": "04:36:18", "text": "正在玩《Valerant》。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16580.23, "timestamp": "04:36:20", "text": "我当时就想，宝贝，怎么了？你可以玩"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16581.75, "timestamp": "04:36:21", "text": "瓦莱兰特"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16585.269, "timestamp": "04:36:25", "text": "你可以在线观看吗？我确实这么做了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16588.07, "timestamp": "04:36:28", "text": "记得搜索过"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16590.949, "timestamp": "04:36:30", "text": "呃，就像比利比利一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16593.109, "timestamp": "04:36:33", "text": "没有。只有在这里，他才会流出这些内容。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16595.91, "timestamp": "04:36:35", "text": "突然出现。我们观看弹出窗口。我当时"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16597.75, "timestamp": "04:36:37", "text": "比如，“等等，什么？”但我从中看到了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16600.709, "timestamp": "04:36:40", "text": "他确实请求了 Embuber 服务器，就像他请求的那样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16603.51, "timestamp": "04:36:43", "text": "合作项目。所以，我算是给了我"}]